    "Debt simplification calculates net balances to reduce the total number of transactions between group members." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Debt simplification calculates net balances to reduce the total number of transactions between group members."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "債務の簡易化は純残高を計算し、メンバー間の取引数を減らします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "부채 단순화는 순잔액을 계산하여 멤버 간 거래 수를 줄입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "债务简化会计算净余额，以减少群组成员之间的交易总数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "債務簡化會計算淨餘額，以減少群組成員之間的交易總數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debt simplification nets balances to reduce transfers between members (greedy heuristic; not a proven global minimum). Amounts are converted to the group currency using in-app static rates (not live FX)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Debt simplification nets balances to reduce transfers between members (greedy heuristic; not a proven global minimum). Amounts are converted to the group currency using in-app static rates (not live FX)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "債務簡易化は残高を相殺し、メンバー間の送金回数を減らします（貪欲法のヒューリスティックであり、大域最適は保証しません）。金額はアプリ内の固定レートでグループ通貨に換算されます（リアルタイム為替ではありません）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "부채 단순화는 잔액을 상계하여 멤버 간 이체 횟수를 줄입니다(탐욕 휴리스틱이며 전역 최소를 보장하지 않음). 금액은 앱 내 고정 환율로 그룹 통화로 환산됩니다(실시간 환율 아님)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "债务简化通过轧差余额减少成员间转账次数（贪心启发式，不保证全局最少笔数）。金额按应用内静态汇率换算为群组币种（非实时外汇）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "債務簡化透過軋差餘額減少成員間轉帳次數（貪心啟發式，不保證全域最少筆數）。金額依應用程式內靜態匯率換算為群組幣別（非即時外匯）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
